note: design 100 (R100.9-1): an extract with a new branch in the code that it leaves is no transformation entry: no entry explains the graph changes, so the step line of the body lists each change and names no entry
rule-: R100.9-1
must_not_match: explained by f
=== both Cargo.toml
[package]
name = "depot"
version = "0.1.0"
edition = "2021"
=== old src/lib.rs
pub fn total(a: u32, b: u32) -> u32 {
    let s = a * 3 + b;
    s + 1
}
=== new src/lib.rs
pub fn total(a: u32, b: u32) -> u32 {
    let s = part(a, b);
    if s > 9 { s + 2 } else { s + 1 }
}

fn part(a: u32, b: u32) -> u32 {
    a * 3 + b
}
